# Feature: Approval workflow

## Chain
Sketch → Punching → Checker → Design Head → Costing → Management/Owner.
Levels are configurable; not every design necessarily needs every level, but
whichever levels are marked mandatory must all reach `APPROVED` before release.

## Rules
- A design cannot enter production release unless mandatory approvals are complete.
- Prevent duplicate active approval at the same level unless explicitly configured.
- Preserve prior decisions - never overwrite an approval history row.
- Decision values: PENDING, APPROVED, REJECTED, CORRECTION_REQUIRED, SKIPPED.

## Entity
`DesignApproval`: ApprovalId, DesignId, TaskId (nullable), ApprovalLevelId,
ApproverEmployeeId, Decision, Remark, DecisionAtUtc.

## API
- `POST /api/approvals` - approve/reject a stage.
